OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclists criticise pavement
OL,4,Aparking crackdown plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorcyclists have criticised a new
OL,7,Fproposal that would place more
OL,8,Frestrictions on pavement parking in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland, claiming they would
OL,10,Fbe "unfairly" targeted.
OL,12,FUnder the plan by the Department for
OL,13,FInfrastructure, all motorists would
OL,14,Fface a #90 fine if they were found to
OL,15,Fhave parked their vehicle wholly on a
OL,16,Fpavement.
OL,18,FThe department said the proposal was
OL,19,F"intended to improve accessibility and
OL,20,Fsafety".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
