OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclists criticise pavement
OL,4,Aparking crackdown plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartyn Boyd from the Motorcycle Action
OL,7,FGroup (MAG) said it meant that cars
OL,8,Fcould be partially parked on pavements
OL,9,Fwithout being penalised - but
OL,10,Fmotorbikes parked "sensibly and
OL,11,Fresponsibly" would have no way of
OL,12,Fescaping the fine.
